### 4. Mock Server Handler (`src/testing/mocks/handlers/comments.ts`)
Added the `PATCH` route to handle the update request on the local mock server.
```typescript
  http.patch(
    `${env.API_URL}/comments/:commentId`,
    async ({ params, request, cookies }) => {
